ils> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:68f342f3-8690-494f-8bd8-7086a262ed58\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:68f342f3-8690-494f-8bd8-7086a262ed58\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In the <a href=\"/wiki/Stormshore_Tabernacle\" title=\"Stormshore Tabernacle\">Stormshore Tabernacle</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;100&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-25</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>To know of Mystra, the goddess of magic, we must first consider her earlier incarnations, beginning with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Mystryl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mystryl\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Mystryl\">Mystryl</a></span>. The Lady of Mysteries was said to have come into existence during a conflict between the goddesses <a href=\"/wiki/Shar\" title=\"Shar\">Shar</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Sel%C3%BBne\" title=\"Selûne\">Selûne</a>. In their efforts to best one another, the twin sisters of darkness and light inadvertently forged a portion of their opposing energies into a new being of pure magic - Mystryl.\n</p><p><br>\nAs an embodiment of magic, Mystryl laid claim to unparalleled control over the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Weave\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Weave\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Weave\">Weave</a></span> - the very fabric by which magic could be channeled and harnessed - for it was but an extension of her being. For her, to use magic was as natural as it would be for another to draw a breath or curl their finger.\n</p><p><br>\nIt was in -339 DR that Mystryl gave way to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Mystra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mystra\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Mystra\">Mystra</a></span>, when the former had her powers seized by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Karsus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Karsus\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Karsus\">Karsus</a></span> - a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Netheril\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Netherese\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Netheril\">Netherese</a></span> lord, and perhaps the most powerful and ambitious wizard to have ever lived. Yet Mystryl sought to deny him his ill-gotten prize - sacrificing herself so that for a moment, the Weave faltered, and all magic briefly ceased. <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Karsus%27s_Folly\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Karsus's Folly\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Karsus%27s_Folly\">Karsus's Folly</a></span> brought about the destruction of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Netheril\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Netheril\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Netheril\">Netheril</a></span> and the end of his ambition. Yet the Weave would not go unattended for long. Within moments, the goddess of magic was reborn, as Mystra.\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>See also:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magical_Histories,_Volume_2:_The_Spellplague\" title=\"Magical Histories, Volume 2: The Spellplague\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Book_Tome_B_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_B_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Book_Tome_B_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Tome_B_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Book_Tome_B_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Tome_B_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Book_Tome_B_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_B_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Book_Tome_B_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Magical_Histories,_Volume_2:_The_Spellplague\" title=\"Magical Histories, Volume 2: The Spellplague\">Magical Histories, Volume 2: The Spellplague</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magical_Histories,_Volume_3:_The_Second_Sundering\" title=\"Magical Histories, Volume 3: The Second Sundering\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Book_Tome_O_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_O_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Book_Tome_O_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Tome_O_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Book_Tome_O_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Tome_O_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Book_Tome_O_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_O_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e0/Book_Tome_O_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Magical_Histories,_Volume_3:_The_Second_Sundering\" title=\"Magical Histories, Volume 3: The Second Sundering\">Magical Histories, Volume 3: The Second Sundering</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magical_Histories,_Volume_4:_The_Chosen_of_Mystra\" title=\"Magical Histories, Volume 4: The Chosen of Mystra\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Book_Tome_O_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_O_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Book_Tome_O_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Tome_O_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Book_Tome_O_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Tome_O_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Book_Tome_O_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_O_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e0/Book_Tome_O_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Magical_Histories,_Volume_4:_The_Chosen_of_Mystra\" title=\"Magical Histories, Volume 4: The Chosen of Mystra\">Magical Histories, Volume 4: The Chosen of Mystra</a></span></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203232\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.087 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.091 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4041/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 71172/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 28894/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.028/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1208001/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   74.044      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   74.044      1 -total\n 48.18%   35.673     14 Template:Icon_text\n 44.99%   33.316     49 Template:Trim\n 27.90%   20.659      9 Template:Icon_link\n 25.18%   18.642      3 Template:MdRarityItem\n 21.06%   15.595      3 Template:Item_icon\n 20.71%   15.334      1 Template:PageSeo\n 20.63%   15.275      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 19.08%   14.130     20 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:31360-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714203232 and revision id 329500. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}